\"><a href=\"#iareacodemanager_areacodedatasource_phone_gps_inline\"></a>PHONE_GPS</font></code></td><td>通过手机的GPS判断国家区域码。</td></tr><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#iareacodemanager_areacodedatasource_mcc_inline\"></a>MCC</font></code></td><td>通过手机的移动国家区域码(MCC)判断国家区域码。</td></tr><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#iareacodemanager_areacodedatasource_ip_inline\"></a>IP</font></code></td><td>通过服务器的IP判断国家区域码。</td></tr><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#iareacodemanager_areacodedatasource_low_accuracy_gps_inline\"></a>LOW_ACCURACY_GPS</font></code></td><td>通过GPS计算最近邻城市判断国家区域码，可信度较低。</td></tr><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#iareacodemanager_areacodedatasource_cache_inline\"></a>CACHE</font></code></td><td>通过缓存获取国家区域码。</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n</font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iareacodemanager_areacodedata_areacodechangelistener\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">class</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a href=\"IAreaCodeManager_AreaCodeData_AreaCodeChangeListener.html\">AreaCodeChangeListener</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc class-inline-doc offline-class-inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iareacodemanager_areacodedata_areacodechangelistener_inline\" data-class-href=\"IAreaCodeManager_AreaCodeData_AreaCodeChangeListener.html\" data-class-name=\"AreaCodeChangeListener\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">class</span><h3>AreaCodeChangeListener</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div><figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"jv-class\">AreaCodeChangeListener</span></span></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p><font color=\"#666\">国家区域码变化监听器。</font></p><p></p></div>\